<%# Overrides component from Blacklight 9.0.0 to render the search bar inside the design system
    header (see Catalog::HeaderComponent's slot="end"), which supplies the viewport margins.

    No wrapper here. Blacklight's version wraps the box in a navigation landmark, but the search bar
    is already a <search> landmark, and a search is not navigation. Both callers supply their own
    positioning element (.fi-header-search in the header, .fi-intro__search-container on the home page). %>
<%= search_bar %>
